ss=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-334576b sc_inner_width_none sc_content_align_inherit sc_layouts_column_icons_position_left sc_fly_static\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-id=\"334576b\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-59b6035 sc_fly_static elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-piechart\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"59b6035\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-piechart.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\">\n<div class=\"ekit-single-piechart withcontent\">\n<div class=\"colorful-chart piechart\" data-color=\"#42A028\" data-gradientcolor1=\"\" data-gradientcolor2=\"\" data-linewidth=\"10\" data-percent=\"80\" data-pie_color_style=\"normal\" data-size=\"150\">\n<span class=\"ekit-chart-content\">80%</span>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"ekit-piechart-title\">Мінімальна економія</h2>\n<p>Це мінімальна річна економія на електроенергії. В реальності ви повністю покриваєте свої потреби та можете заробляти на продажу.</p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c61db6 sc_fly_static elementor-widget elementor-widget-trx_sc_button\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"0c61db6\" data-widget_type=\"trx_sc_button.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"sc_item_button sc_button_wrap sc_align_center\"><a class=\"sc_button sc_button_default sc_button_size_normal sc_button_icon_left\" href=\"#alteco-modal-overlay\" id=\"popup-form\" onclick=\"if(window.openAltecoModal){openAltecoModal();return false;}\"><span class=\"sc_button_text\"><span class=\"sc_button_title\">Консультація</span></span></a></div>\n</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-dddb9c0 sc_inner_width_none sc_content_align_inherit sc_layouts_column_icons_position_left sc_fly_static\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-id=\"dddb9c0\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6fea1ac sc_fly_static elementor-widget elementor-widget-trx_sc_calculated_fields_form\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"6fea1ac\" data-widget_type=\"trx_sc_calculated_fields_form.default\">\n<div class=\"alteco-solar-calculator\" style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 2px solid #52B238; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px 28px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #161D22; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\">\n            ⚡ Калькулятор окупності та генерації\n        </div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n<label style=\"display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 6px;\"><br />\n                Поточний тариф за електроенергію (грн / кВт·год)<br />\n            </label></p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\">\n<input id=\"calc_tariff\" max=\"20\" min=\"1\" step=\"0.01\" style=\"flex: 1; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #161D22; outline: none;\" type=\"number\" value=\"4.32\"/><br />\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">грн</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 22px;\">\n<label style=\"display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 6px;\"><br />\n                Бажана потужність сонячної станції (кВт)<br />\n            </label></p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n<input id=\"calc_power\" max=\"50\" min=\"1\" step=\"1\" style=\"flex: 1; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #161D22; outline: none;\" type=\"number\" value=\"10\"/><br />\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">кВт</span>\n</div>\n<p><input id=\"calc_power_range\" max=\"50\" min=\"1\" step=\"1\" style=\"width: 100%; accent-color: #52B238; cursor: pointer;\" type=\"range\" value=\"10\"/>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 22px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #64748b;\">Щорічна генерація:</span><br />\n<span id=\"calc_result_gen\" style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #161D22;\">11 500 кВт·год</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-top: 1px dashed #cbd5e1; padding-top: 12px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #161D22;\">Ваша економія за рік:</span><br />\n<span id=\"calc_result_savings\" style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #52B238;\">49 680 грн</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><button class=\"alteco-calc-cta-btn\" onclick=\"openAltecoModal()\" style=\"width: 100%; background: #52B238; color: #ffffff; padding: 15px; border: none; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.2s ease; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(82, 178, 56, 0.3);\" type=\"button\"><br />\n            Отримати детальний розрахунок →<br />\n        </button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-2a02cc4 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default sc_fly_static\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-id=\"2a02cc4\">\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-39f9386 sc_inner_width_none sc_content_align_inherit sc_layouts_colum