%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-src=\"https://alteco.latul.space/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/profits-graph.svg\" class=\"attachment- size- lazy\" alt></div></div><div class=\"box-body\"><h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\"> Великий ресурс</h3><p>Більше 6000 циклів розряд-заряд, що дає понад 15 років служби.</p></div></div> </a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a781574 sc_inner_width_none sc_content_align_inherit sc_layouts_column_icons_position_left sc_fly_static\" data-id=\"a781574\" data-element_type=\"column\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\"><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43ed290 ekit-equal-height-disable sc_fly_static elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"43ed290\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\"><div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><div class=\"ekit-wid-con\"> <a href=\"#\" class=\"ekit_global_links\"><div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-center text- icon-top-align elementor-animation-   \"><div class=\"elementskit-box-header\"><div class=\"elementskit-info-box-icon \"> <img width=\"501\" height=\"501\" src=\"image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20501%20501%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-src=\"https://alteco.latul.space/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/growth-up.svg\" class=\"attachment- size- lazy\" alt></div></div><div class=\"box-body\"><h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\"> Висока ефективність</h3><p>КПД системи понад 97%. Швидкий час заряду 1-2 години.</p></div></div> </a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-97d4eee sc_inner_width_none sc_content_align_inherit sc_layouts_column_icons_position_left sc_fly_static\" data-id=\"97d4eee\" data-element_type=\"column\"><div class=\"element